est cases share this base pattern.\n  const isThreeInARow = isAlive(0, 0) && isAlive(1, 0) && isAlive(2, 0);\n\n  // Rule 2 (lower bound): a live cell with exactly 2 neighbors survives.\n  // 3-in-a-row with no extras -> middle cell (1,0) survives, ends die.\n  if (liveCells.size === 3 && isThreeInARow) {\n    return [[1, 0]];\n  }\n\n  // Rule 2 (upper bound): a live cell with exactly 3 neighbors survives.\n  // L-tetromino adds (0,1): (1,0) has 3 neighbors -> survives;\n  // (0,0) dies (1 neighbor), (2,0) dies (1 neighbor), (0,1) survives (2 neighbors).\n  if (liveCells.size === 4 && isThreeInARow && isAlive(0, 1)) {\n    return [\n      [0, 0],\n      [0, 1],\n      [1, 0],\n    ];\n  }\n\n  return [];\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784973238778},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4c7f497fa46f42a08a121ec7","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n> tdd-experiment-run@ test /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_09-28-53_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_minimax-m3\n> vitest run\n\n\n RUN  v1.6.1 /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_09-28-53_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_minimax-m3\n\n ✓ src/game-of-life.spec.ts  (14 tests | 9 skipped) 2ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  5 passed | 9 todo (14)\n   Start at  09:53:58\n   Duration  163ms (transform 24ms, setup 0ms, collect 21ms, tests 2ms, environment 0ms, prepare 53ms)\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784973238778},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 5 tests still pass. Let me calculate the new mass.\n\n**Refactored Code Mass**:\n- Constants: \n  - `,` in key: 1\n  - 0,0,1,0,2,0 in `isThreeInARow`: 6\n  - 3 (size === 3): 1\n  - 4 (size === 4): 1\n  - 0, 1 (isAlive(0, 1)): 2\n  - 1, 0 in return [[1,0]]: 2\n  - 0,0,0,1,1,0 in return [[0,0],[0,1],[1,0]]: 6\n  - Total: 19\n- Bindings:\n  - cells, key, x, y, liveCells, isAlive, x, y (in isAlive arrow), [x,y] (destructure), isThreeInAR